{"job_id":"F-b62d690f671fdd434f7f","family_id":"F-b62d690f671fdd434f7f","title":"육군정보통신학교령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":9,"target_id":"10d3ddd64cee5ae48f261caa7b578b31d20d47f399a062c13589c84915e87f2a","source_hash":"5b07190c316824fa8b896245439a551fa65351197c4cb5b498ca897a33c0b4fd","text":"陆军信息与通信学校规章"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":106,"target_id":"f34b1182c3fa33138b9b2b870edc5b411773164b7696759ff6dafc05eb862aea","source_hash":"a0701578f84afd691f7e6466daf33003136243910ea776c1a4e6d3f6e5a5681f","text":"제1조(설치와 임무)\n①陆军信息与通信学校应在陆军中设立。\n陆军信息与通信学校研究和发展信息与通信部门的战术和理论，并通过对该部门的军官和士兵进行教育来培养专业人才。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":106,"end":302,"target_id":"efd4829eb37065b84a584732074c6616ccc18e6a0293f5df3594f38a45af4aa5","source_hash":"c06e5135f9e0bab0e17234d981b2313b86a7fcfd37b5f2fe4fa5b032c522195d","text":"제2조(교장)\n①陆军信息与通信学校应任命一名校长。\n②校长应从陆军将官或二级及以上文职人员中任命。<2025年9月2日修订>\n③ 学校督导员奉陆军参谋长之命，负责监督学校事务，并指挥和监督参谋部门和单位。\n④ 如果校长因不可避免的情况无法履行其职责，则由行政主管或系主任中的资深人士代为履行其职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":302,"end":448,"target_id":"84d6857d9379e9c3c227b8c6533def8cd6433facc33c6bce6386cd590c220bfc","source_hash":"8f8d7b4476b5dfcd3a0910ef58d929d6135121f3702e70014fcf0a308f4e22c1","text":"第三条（参谋部门和单位的设立）\n① 陆军信息与通信学校可设立必要的参谋部门和单位，例如行政部门和教务部门。\n② 根据第1款，有关参谋部门的设立和职责划分的事项，由陆军参谋长决定；有关部队的设立、任务和组织事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":448,"end":512,"target_id":"2f43b80481305e5212a96651af8d842e89a0d1ff77f08a7067277298b3aa2d5e","source_hash":"b7ee38482ee3f54aaa4581345b87b34edf2b79800a23c060afb2d54f2a655f04","text":"第四条（课程等）陆军信息与通信学校的课程、课时以及其他有关其运作的事项，由陆军参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":512,"end":560,"target_id":"552b423a4d4bf6683c0545a22562b269709fd74c7f051b8ea6e127b2ec2ac05b","source_hash":"99f8ae2b663169bc952140aceffbfb024e602e18cb396581bc6c502b2b9bb23a","text":"第五条（人员配额）驻扎在陆军信息通信学校的军事人员和文职人员的人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":560,"end":604,"target_id":"200bde3ba7152cdd4451197b90e5a3b86ecade62e9602bafa8b21f535deed005","source_hash":"2cd7ed75ea9ecf3acea3dadc981897f3128badbdf11bfd214db8e35edf256c71","text":"补充条款 <第19681号，2006年9月22日>\n\n本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":604,"end":637,"target_id":"390b6b58be119d0a06bd6fda9b9643b96dec1ab48bfd21793cc5ad52229e0524","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令》）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":637,"end":674,"target_id":"d7a7e4db666e353aa5289e02e4979b70f5597cf447332d290388cd3bc2b63e49","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":674,"end":688,"target_id":"155cf6228b3b106751b543ac2774da11b3742c4cd6a02151657822d61efa67cb","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第 2 条和第 3 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":688,"end":809,"target_id":"127482fa1f5b4bfb0a227a17bc6e1a30caad3eb41fb392724e75334d696a6cb1","source_hash":"5f41e7b712ae0f514956f490c7419a87a631c14c5bc349b4c2dc3abd3cf8d528","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<64> 已省略\n\n  <65> 陆军信息与通信学校规章部分修订如下。\n\n  第 2 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <66> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010288-273555-ko","scope":"BODY","start":809,"end":893,"target_id":"f15778a6d6f9d2ef234b13efa03dbb719bc07ff95a76362198358222717240c4","source_hash":"12fb47a24a8a8d48c76b328876ef72f13041b533e51fcc7761110c3332d77371","text":"增补（关于部分修改九项法令以提高军事组织运作效率的总统令）<第35726号，2025年9月2日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}